# The marketing site is static and talks to nothing. This is its only variable.
#
# ⚠️ There is no delivery yet: the contact form writes to the log and returns
# success. Set this to a Slack or Discord incoming webhook and submissions get
# posted there. Leave it blank and the form still "works" — it just goes
# nowhere, which is worth knowing before you put the URL on a billboard.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
